{"id":"1beadb4465fe1e39","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-thm-feynman-kac.md","title":"Feynman–Kac Formula","display":"thm-feynman-kac — Feynman–Kac Formula","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-feynman-kac","aliases":["58-thm-feynman-kac"],"display":"thm-feynman-kac — Feynman–Kac Formula","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-df-markov-process.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-differential-equation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-feynman-kac"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-feynman-kac</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-feynman-kac — Feynman–Kac Formula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6c6a1de6afbc3124\" href=\"?note=6c6a1de6afbc3124\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-markov-process.md\">../batch14/58-df-markov-process.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cfa80659b9d38f63\" href=\"?note=cfa80659b9d38f63\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-differential-equation.md\">../batch04/58-df-differential-equation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X_t)_{t\\geq0}\">\\((X_t)_{t\\geq0}\\)</span> is a Markov process on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> with generator <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V:D\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(V:D\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:D\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(f:D\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span> satisfy the standard integrability and regularity conditions ensuring uniqueness.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MarkovGenerator}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{MarkovGenerator}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AdmissibleFKData}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{AdmissibleFKData}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassicalFKSolution}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassicalFKSolution}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}feynman\\text{-}kac\\text{-}solution}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ClassicalFKSolution}_S(u,L,V,f,D)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\forall t&gt;0\\;\\forall x\\in D\\;\n\\partial_tu(t,x)=L(u(t,-))(x)-V(x)u(t,x),\\\\\n\\forall x\\in D\\;(u(0,x)=f(x))\n\\end{array}\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}feynman\\text{-}kac\\text{-}solution}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ClassicalFKSolution}_S(u,L,V,f,D)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\forall t&gt;0\\;\\forall x\\in D\\;\n\\partial_tu(t,x)=L(u(t,-))(x)-V(x)u(t,x),\\\\\n\\forall x\\in D\\;(u(0,x)=f(x))\n\\end{array}\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}feynman\\text{-}kac}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MarkovGenerator}_S(X,L,D)\n\\land\\mathrm{AdmissibleFKData}_S(V,f,X,D)\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{ClassicalFKSolution}_S(u,L,V,f,D)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall t\\geq0\\;\\forall x\\in D\\;\nu(t,x)=\n\\mathbb E_x\n\\left[\n\\exp\\left(-\\int_0^tV(X_s)\\,ds\\right)f(X_t)\n\\right]\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}feynman\\text{-}kac}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MarkovGenerator}_S(X,L,D)\n\\land\\mathrm{AdmissibleFKData}_S(V,f,X,D)\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{ClassicalFKSolution}_S(u,L,V,f,D)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall t\\geq0\\;\\forall x\\in D\\;\nu(t,x)=\n\\mathbb E_x\n\\left[\n\\exp\\left(-\\int_0^tV(X_s)\\,ds\\right)f(X_t)\n\\right]\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Boundary or killing terms require the corresponding stopping-time version.</li>\n<li>The admissibility clause contains the regularity and integrability assumptions needed for both the representation and uniqueness.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-markov-process.md","status":"resolved","id":"6c6a1de6afbc3124","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-markov-process.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-differential-equation.md","status":"resolved","id":"cfa80659b9d38f63","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-differential-equation.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X_t)_{t\\geq0}","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"V:D\\to\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"f:D\\to\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MarkovGenerator}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AdmissibleFKData}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClassicalFKSolution}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}feynman\\text{-}kac\\text{-}solution}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ClassicalFKSolution}_S(u,L,V,f,D)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\forall t>0\\;\\forall x\\in D\\;\n\\partial_tu(t,x)=L(u(t,-))(x)-V(x)u(t,x),\\\\\n\\forall x\\in D\\;(u(0,x)=f(x))\n\\end{array}\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}feynman\\text{-}kac}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MarkovGenerator}_S(X,L,D)\n\\land\\mathrm{AdmissibleFKData}_S(V,f,X,D)\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{ClassicalFKSolution}_S(u,L,V,f,D)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall t\\geq0\\;\\forall x\\in D\\;\nu(t,x)=\n\\mathbb E_x\n\\left[\n\\exp\\left(-\\int_0^tV(X_s)\\,ds\\right)f(X_t)\n\\right]\n\\right].","display":true}],"bytes":1520,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4145","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-thm-feynman-kac.md|58-thm-feynman-kac]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["6c6a1de6afbc3124","cfa80659b9d38f63"]}